{"title":"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 38","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_38&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The sides <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/b/7ab17967324fc2b12349c0610c6c256f4c829162.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$PQ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"30\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/6/ec6916b50feec24773d374eaada26a95bcabc6fd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$PR$\" width=\"28\" height=\"12\" /> of triangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/c/91c587b0c1e5de0bde79b9d8c36913c16dee04d9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$PQR$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"42\" height=\"16\" /> are respectively of lengths <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> inches, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> inches. The median <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/8/80879b243f734e54b71362c7486c965353c210f3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$PM$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"36\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/f/d5f12573b88cd8f6782e8cc07a81702df196c36d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3\\frac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"20\" height=\"37\" /> inches. Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/7/9a7c52aff9dd9987076c0ac4fecccf59b6ed8bdb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$QR$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"28\" height=\"16\" />, in inches, is:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/6/e76ca812b35c773ba3b32a35779588a60de6d8f8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }6\\qquad\\textbf{(B) }7\\qquad\\textbf{(C) }8\\qquad\\textbf{(D) }9\\qquad \\textbf{(E) }10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"362\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_38&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>By the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Median_Formula&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Median Formula (page does not exist)\">Median Formula</a>, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/2/152065f4a9bedb6d5636979c3de9a1ab09b00aa4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$PM = \\frac12\\sqrt{2PQ^2+2PR^2-QR^2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"259\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p>Plugging in the numbers given in the problem, we get\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/b/50b4be617cd04dd5a1650b10c228240e6446502f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac72=\\frac12\\sqrt{2\\cdot4^2+2\\cdot7^2-QR^2}\\]\" width=\"224\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p>Solving,\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/9/05927162753a788c47de2af6c1ef9e12200c87dd.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[7=\\sqrt{2(16)+2(49)-QR^2}\\]\" width=\"213\" height=\"32\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/6/c/a6cfed95c7269cdff404d5ef0044a55c141dd21a.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[49=32+98-QR^2\\]\" width=\"157\" height=\"19\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/4/e/e4e8f61fa18acb795618aae90aac7d1b4aa47137.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[QR^2=81\\]\" width=\"76\" height=\"18\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/8/84803dd234b46ffe7c3c4e65b2ad3a833e7603d7.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[QR=9=\\boxed{D}\\]\" width=\"112\" height=\"24\" />\n</p><p>-AOPS81619\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_38&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME\" title=\"1964 AHSME\">1964 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1964 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1964\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_37\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 37\">Problem 37</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_39\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 39\">Problem 39</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problem